    "body": "## What changed\n\n- Add native Codex integration:\n  - managed `[tui].status_line` with model, directory, branch, context, and rate-limit fields\n  - saved `/prompts:cockpit` prompt\n  - install/uninstall ownership safeguards\n- Add native Cursor `/cockpit` project command.\n- Show Codex and Cursor surfaces in `cockpit systems`.\n- Update tests, README, and CHANGELOG for the v0.4.0 release.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `go test ./...`\n- `go test ./... -race -count=1`\n- `go vet ./...`\n- `git diff --check`\n- v0.4.0 build/version/statusline/install smoke tests",
